# Mobile / remote Cursor ops (all projects)

Owner instructs from the **Cursor mobile app** (often on a private worker PC). Treat requests as **full desktop authority** across every project in this workspace.

## Projects in scope

| Project | Path | Phone instruct examples |
|---------|------|-------------------------|
| Trading app / engine | `src/`, `scripts/`, MetaAPI | 봇 켜/꺼, 전략 수정, 엔진 고치기 |
| Logic factory | `scripts/lab/`, invent24 | 팩토리 상태, invent 재시작 |
| Naver blog SEO (콘텐츠·이미지 자동화) | `naver-blog-seo/` | 글 1건 생성, 스케줄, dry-run |
| Ads / brand assets | `toss-ads-*.png`, scripts | 아이콘·배너 수정 |

## Do

- Edit **any** named area end-to-end (code → QA → commit/push/PR). Do not send them back to a PC GUI.
- When they say “모든 프로젝트 / 다 / 영상·자동화 / PC처럼”, cover remaining slices in order — **do not refuse**.
- Prefer private-worker shell for local automation (`naver-blog-seo`, factory supervise).
- Trading: use admin `accountId` targeting when editing another MT5 account.

## Local automation commands (private worker)

```bash
# Blog / content images (naver-blog-seo)
cd naver-blog-seo
python scripts/remote_ctl.py status
python scripts/remote_ctl.py dry-run --count 1
python scripts/remote_ctl.py once --count 1
python scripts/remote_ctl.py schedule
python scripts/remote_ctl.py stop

# Logic factory invent
powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts/start-factory-invent.ps1
```

## Still fail-closed (live money)

- Cases → risks → cost before trading-engine changes.
- Never force-close on API lag / partial orphan alone.
- Do not change open-basket logic mid-flight unless explicitly requested.
- No global sub-second polling of all accounts.
- Naver: prefer `AUTO_PUBLISH=false` unless user explicitly asks to publish.

